---
import { getTravelSeries } from "../utils/travel-series";
const travelSeries = await getTravelSeries();
import { apiBase } from "../utils/services";
import { url } from "../utils/url-utils";
import "../styles/article-media.css";
import "../styles/comments.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" /><title>嘴哥 · 记录管理</title><link rel="icon" href={url("/favicon-graffiti.png")} /></head>
<body data-editor-api={apiBase}>
  <header><a href={url("/")} data-no-swup>← 回到博客</a><strong>嘴哥 · 记录管理</strong><button id="logout" hidden>退出管理</button></header>
  <main id="swup-container">
    <section id="login-panel" class="panel login-panel"><p class="eyebrow">留住值得记住的小事</p><h1>专用管理入口</h1><p class="muted">用自己保存的免密码管理入口打开，就能写日记、整理相册和回复留言。首次进入后，这台设备会记住管理权限。</p><p class="note muted small">请保管好专用入口，需要在新设备上管理时，再用它打开。</p><p id="login-status" role="status" class="status"></p></section>
    <div id="editor-panel" hidden>
      <nav class="editor-tabs"><button data-mode="post" class="active">日记与碎片</button><button data-mode="album">相册</button><button data-mode="friends">友链</button><button data-mode="comments">留言</button><span id="storage-status" class="muted"></span></nav>
      <details class="panel local-drafts"><summary id="local-draft-count">本机未提交的记录</summary><p class="muted small">只保存文字、设置和图片链接，不复制原图，不占网站存储。仅限当前浏览器；清除浏览器数据会丢失暂存，不会同步到其他设备。</p><div id="local-draft-list"></div></details>
      <div id="record-layout" class="record-layout">
        <aside class="panel records"><button id="new-record" class="primary">＋ 新建记录</button><div id="record-list"></div></aside>
        <section class="panel record-editor">
          <form id="record-form">
            <div class="row post-only"><label>类型<select id="category"><option>生活碎片</option><option>旅行日记</option><option value="">无</option></select></label><label class="checkbox"><input id="featured" type="checkbox" />设为精选</label></div>
            <label><span id="title-label">标题</span><input id="record-title" maxlength="160" placeholder="给这次记录起个名字" required /></label>
            <div class="row"><label>日期<input id="record-date" type="date" required /></label><label class="post-only">标签<input id="tags" placeholder="旅行、杭州、日常…" /></label></div>
            <label><span id="description-label">简短介绍</span><textarea id="description" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="用一句话介绍这次记录（可选）"></textarea></label>
            <fieldset class="series-fields"><legend>旅行系列（可选）</legend><label>系列名称<input id="series" maxlength="80" list="travel-series-options" placeholder="例如：2026 国庆之旅" /><datalist id="travel-series-options">{travelSeries.map(series => <option value={series.name} />)}</datalist></label><p class="muted small">同一趟旅行的日记和相册填写相同名称，就会自动归到一起；留空则不加入系列。</p><div class="row"><label>旅行日期<input id="tripDate" type="date" /></label><label>地点<input id="location" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：杭州 · 西湖" /></label><label>系列顺序<input id="seriesOrder" type="number" min="1" max="9999" step="1" placeholder="可选，如 1、2、3" /></label></div><p class="muted small">填写顺序的记录优先按数字排列，其余按旅行日期排列；旅行日期留空时使用记录日期。</p></fieldset>
            <section class="post-only body-composer" aria-labelledby="record-body-label"><div class="body-heading"><strong id="record-body-label">正文</strong><button id="insert-photo" type="button" disabled>＋ 在光标处插入照片</button></div><p class="muted small">点进文字段落，选好位置后插入照片；图片下方可以继续写下一段。</p><div class="composer-heading-tools" role="group" aria-label="正文小标题"><button type="button" data-heading-level="2">大标题</button><button type="button" data-heading-level="3">小标题</button><button type="button" data-heading-level="0">恢复正文</button><span class="muted small">光标放在文字行中选择层级，预览可查看字号与排版。</span></div><p id="heading-status" class="status small" role="status"></p><div id="body-editor"></div><textarea id="record-body" hidden></textarea></section>
            <section class="upload-area"><div><strong>照片与视频</strong><p id="media-note" class="muted small">照片按原图上传，不压缩，保留设备上的原件。照片和视频每个最多64 MB。</p></div><label id="choose-media" class="upload-button">＋ 选择照片或视频<input id="media-files" type="file" disabled multiple accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif,video/mp4,video/webm" /></label><p id="upload-status" role="status" class="status"></p><div id="media-list" class="media-list"></div><div class="post-only row video-link"><input id="video-url" type="url" placeholder="也可以粘贴已有视频的 HTTPS 直链" /><button id="add-video" type="button">添加视频链接</button></div></section>
            <p id="local-save-status" class="status" role="status"></p><button id="export-local-record" type="button">导出当前内容到本机</button>
            <section id="record-conflict" class="conflict-panel" hidden><strong>线上已有不同版本，你的本机修改已保留</strong><p>下方是线上最新内容，当前编辑框保留本机内容。可以导出备份，或另存为新记录；不会强行覆盖线上版本。</p><label>线上最新内容（只读）<textarea id="latest-record" readonly rows="8"></textarea></label><div class="actions"><button id="reload-latest-record" type="button">重新读取线上版本</button><button id="copy-local-record" type="button">将本机内容另存为新记录</button></div></section>
            <div class="actions"><button id="save-draft" type="button">保存草稿</button><button id="publish" class="primary" type="submit">发布记录</button><button id="preview-toggle" type="button">预览</button></div>
            <p id="save-status" role="status" class="status"></p>
            <p class="muted small">草稿暂不显示在博客，但公开仓库仍可查看源文件。私密内容请留在本地。</p>
          </form>
          <section id="preview" hidden><h2 id="preview-title"></h2><div id="preview-body"></div><div id="preview-media" class="media-list"></div></section>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section id="friends-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>朋友的小站</h2><p class="muted small">网站简介介绍对方的内容；嘴哥备注可以留空，填写后会显示在友链页面和侧栏。</p><div id="friend-list"></div><div class="actions"><button id="add-friend">＋ 添加友链</button><button id="save-friends" class="primary">保存友链</button></div><p id="friends-status" role="status" class="status"></p></section>
      <section id="comments-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>最近的留言</h2><div id="admin-comment-list"></div><p id="comments-status" role="status" class="status"></p></section>
    </div>
  </main><div id="toc" hidden></div>
  <script>import "../scripts/editor";</script>
</body></html>
<style is:global>
  body { margin:0; background:#f1f5f4; color:#243d36; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif; line-height:1.65; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; } button,input,textarea,select { font:inherit; } button { cursor:pointer; border:1px solid #d6e2dd; border-radius:10px; background:white; color:#24483b; padding:.65rem 1rem; } button:hover { background:#edf7f0; } button:disabled { opacity:.5; cursor:wait; }
  header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; padding:1rem max(1rem,calc((100vw - 1160px)/2)); background:white; border-bottom:1px solid #e0e9e4; } header a { color:#38725a; text-decoration:none; }
  main { max-width:1160px; margin:2rem auto; padding:0 1rem; } .panel { background:white; padding:1.5rem; border-radius:18px; border:1px solid #e1e9e5; } h1,h2 { margin:.3rem 0 1rem; font-weight:700; } h1 { font-size:2rem; } h2 { font-size:1.4rem; } .muted { color:#73857c; } .small { font-size:.85rem; } .eyebrow { color:#378c5a; font-weight:600; } .login-panel { max-width:490px; margin:5vh auto; padding:2rem; } .login-panel form { margin-top:1.5rem; display:grid; gap:1rem; }
  label { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.4rem; font-weight:500; margin-bottom:1rem; } input:not([type=checkbox]),textarea,select { width:100%; padding:.7rem .9rem; border:1px solid #d8e3dd; border-radius:10px; background:#fbfdfc; outline:none; color:#243d36; } input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus { border-color:#49a16c; } textarea { resize:vertical; } .primary { background:#237b47; color:white; border-color:#237b47; } .primary:hover { background:#196839; }
  .editor-tabs { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; margin-bottom:1rem; } .editor-tabs .active { background:#237b47; color:white; } #storage-status { margin-left:auto; font-size:.85rem; } .record-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:210px 1fr; gap:1rem; } .records { padding:1rem; align-self:start; } .records>.primary { width:100%; margin-bottom:1rem; } #record-list { display:grid; gap:.4rem; } #record-list button { text-align:left; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .row { display:flex; gap:1rem; align-items:start; } .row>label { flex:1; } .checkbox { flex-direction:row; align-items:center; padding-top:2rem; } .actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.6rem; margin-top:1rem; } .status { min-height:1.5rem; color:#61756a; font-size:.9rem; overflow-wrap:anywhere; } .status.error { color:#b63a34; } .status a { color:#237b47; text-decoration:underline; }
  .upload-area { padding:1rem; border:1px dashed #c9dacf; border-radius:12px; margin:1rem 0; } .upload-button { display:inline-flex; margin:1rem 0 .4rem; background:#edf7f0; padding:.6rem 1rem; border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer; } .upload-button input { display:none; } .upload-button.unavailable { opacity:.5; cursor:not-allowed; } .media-list { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.8rem; } .media-item { border:1px solid #e0e9e4; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; padding:.5rem; } .media-item img,.media-item video { width:100%; aspect-ratio:1; object-fit:cover; border-radius:8px; } .media-item input { font-size:.8rem; margin-top:.5rem; } .media-controls { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.3rem; margin-top:.4rem; } .media-controls button { font-size:.75rem; padding:.2rem .4rem; } .video-link { margin-top:1rem; }
  #preview { margin-top:2rem; border-top:1px solid #e1e9e5; padding-top:1.5rem; } #preview-body img { max-width:100%; border-radius:10px; } #preview-body h2 { margin-top:1.5rem; } #preview-body p { margin:.8rem 0; } #preview-body ul { list-style:disc; padding-left:1.5rem; } #preview-body pre { overflow:auto; padding:1rem; background:#edf4ef; border-radius:10px; }
  .composer-heading-tools { display:flex; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.5rem; margin-top:.8rem; } .composer-heading-tools button { padding:.35rem .7rem; } .composer-heading-tools [data-heading-level="2"] { font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; } .composer-heading-tools [data-heading-level="3"] { font-weight:600; } #heading-status:empty { display:none; } #preview-body h2 { font-size:1.6rem; } #preview-body h3 { font-size:1.25rem; }
  .body-composer { margin:0 0 1.5rem; } .body-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.6rem; } .body-heading button { background:#edf7f0; font-size:.9rem; } #body-editor { display:grid; gap:1rem; margin-top:.8rem; } .composer-text textarea { min-height:130px; display:block; } .composer-photo { margin:0; padding:.8rem; border:1px solid #d8e3dd; border-radius:12px; background:#fbfdfc; } .composer-photo>img { display:block; width:100%; max-height:440px; object-fit:contain; border-radius:8px; } .composer-photo>input { margin-top:.7rem; } .composer-photo-actions { display:flex; gap:.4rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:.6rem; } .composer-photo-actions button { padding:.35rem .7rem; font-size:.85rem; }
  .friend-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.35rem 1rem; margin:1rem 0; padding:1rem; border:1px solid #e1e9e5; border-radius:12px; background:#fbfdfc; } .friend-row-heading { grid-column:1/-1; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:.4rem; } .friend-row-heading button { padding:.3rem .65rem; font-size:.85rem; } .friend-field { min-width:0; margin:0; } .friend-field textarea { min-height:5rem; } .admin-comment { padding:1rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e1e9e5; } .admin-comment p { white-space:pre-wrap; overflow-wrap:anywhere; } .admin-comment textarea { margin-top:.7rem; } [hidden] { display:none!important; }
  .local-drafts { margin-bottom:1rem; } .local-drafts summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:600; } .local-draft-row { padding:.8rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e1e9e5; overflow-wrap:anywhere; } .local-draft-row button { font-size:.85rem; padding:.4rem .7rem; } .series-fields { border:1px solid #d8e3dd; border-radius:12px; padding:1rem; margin:1rem 0 1.5rem; min-width:0; } .series-fields legend { padding:0 .4rem; font-weight:600; } .conflict-panel { padding:1rem; margin:1rem 0; border:1px solid #dbaf68; border-radius:12px; background:#fffaf0; }
  @media(max-width:700px) { main { margin:1rem auto; } header { flex-wrap:wrap; } .record-layout { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .records { padding:.8rem; } #record-list { display:flex; overflow:auto; max-height:140px; } #record-list button { flex-shrink:0; max-width:170px; } .row { flex-direction:column; gap:0; } .row>label { width:100%; } .checkbox { padding-top:0; } .media-list { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } .friend-row { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .video-link { gap:.5rem; } }
</style>
